  "bodyHtml": "<style type=\"text/css\">.news-img-a1 {\r\n  margin-top: 15px;\r\n  vertical-align: middle;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n<p>Aquasky&#39;s partner Elbi America &amp; Duratrac went to present Aquasky ThermPlus Expansion Tank at AHR 2018.&nbsp;<br />\r\nThe International Air-Conditioning, Heating, Refrigerating Exposition (AHR Expo), which started 86 years ago as a heating and ventilation show, has grown into the event of the year for the HVACR industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-001.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-005.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-006.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-002.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-003.jpg\" /></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-md-4 news-img-a1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" src=\"/upfile/Images/news/20180206news-004.jpg\" /></div>",
